rp:TenantLabelled a sh:NodeShape ;
	rdfs:comment "A mixin for what carries a tenant's label, one line of 1 to 200 characters that neither starts nor ends in a space; the access record and the service's request bodies share it, so the label is checked the same everywhere." ;
